                <pb facs="0410" n="360" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg360"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure No. 2 in No. 67.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Remarks of President Dole to Mr. Willis.</hi></head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: It is with sincere gratification
                    that I have received the information that the President of the United States has
                    confirmed the recognition so promptly extended by your excellency to the
                    Republic of Hawaii.</p>
                <p>Permit me on behalf of the Hawaiian people to reciprocate the friendly sentiments
                    expressed by you toward this Government and to assure you of our desire that
                    relations of comity and of commercial intercourse which shall be mutually
                    advantageous, may ever exist between the two countries.</p>
            </div>
